    "updated_at": "2026-11-24T22:46:50Z",
    "body": "Note on this issue: the run that opened it failed on a runner fault, not on a test.\n\n- Run 45503532090, main `33597a2fb`: `Permission denied (os error 13)` on the CARGO_HOME git database under `/usr/local/cargo`, exit 101.\n- No `FAIL` row and no `STALL` row.\n- The same fault hit two earlier runs (`95e01ce28`-era `d4601c6ea` and `b13ebd440`); both passed when re-run.\n\nThis is the third occurrence today. It is logged on #3303. The runner's CARGO_HOME ownership needs a fix by the maintainer; a re-run is queued. This issue closes itself on the next green run.\n",
